<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Join Us for a Virtual Public Meeting About the New Columbus Creative Campus</h1>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Join us for a virtual public meeting to learn more about the City of Columbus' new Creative Campus in Olde Towne East!</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The City is developing the new campus to provide creative programming and wellness activities for all community members. In addition to housing many of the popular programs from the Martin Janis Community Senior Center and Golden Hobby Shop, there is an opportunity to offer new programs and amenities in this space.</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">This is an opportunity to learn more, ask questions and share any additional comments.</p>
<h2 class="has-text-align-center has-secondary-color has-text-color has-large-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #CB343C; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Virtual Public Meeting</strong></h2>
<h2 class="has-text-align-center has-secondary-color has-text-color has-large-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #CB343C; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Wednesday, June 23, from 5:30-7 p.m.</strong></h2>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">To join the virtual meeting, visit <a href="http://zoom.com/join?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">zoom.com/join.</a></p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Meeting ID: </strong>964 9949 3626</p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Passcode:</strong> 977016</p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-secondary-color has-text-color has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">OR</p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-foreground-color has-text-color has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Audio Only:</strong> Call 929-205-6099.</p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Meeting ID: </strong>964 9949 3626</p>
<p class="has-text-align-center has-small-font-size" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Passcode:</strong> 977016</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Visit <a href="https://cbuscreativecampus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Columbus Creative Campus Website" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CbusCreativeCampus.com</a> to learn more!</p>
</td>
</tr>
