<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Don't Forget! Share Your Input About the New Columbus Creative Campus</h1>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">There's still time to share what you want to see in the City of Columbus'  new Creative Campus in Olde Towne East! </p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The City is developing the new campus to provide creative programming and wellness activities for all community members. In addition to housing many of the popular programs from the Martin Janis Community Senior Center and Golden Hobby Shop, there is an opportunity to offer new programs and amenities in this space.</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Your feedback will help shape what programs and amenities will be included within the building and on the surrounding greenspace. Tell us what you would like to see by completing a brief online survey.</p>
<p class="has-text-color" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Visit <a href="https://cbuscreativecampus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Columbus Creative Campus Website" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CbusCreativeCampus.com</a> to learn more and take the survey!</p>
